1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

2
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:26,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, shall we be off, then?</b></font>

3
00:00:32,570 --> 00:00:38,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>FRIEREN: BEYOND JOURNEY'S END</b></font>

4
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:39,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[cart wheels rattling]</b></font>

5
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:41,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

6
00:00:45,630 --> 00:00:48,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren sighs] It's unusually
warm today.</b></font>

7
00:00:48,510 --> 00:00:51,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] It is. I'll take
the bonus warmth.</b></font>

8
00:00:51,390 --> 00:00:53,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I would prefer
some cold, hard cash,</b></font>

9
00:00:53,260 --> 00:00:54,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if you know what I mean.</b></font>

10
00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:57,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Four measly coins.</b></font>

11
00:00:57,640 --> 00:01:00,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We'll have to look for work
in the next town.</b></font>

12
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:01,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We haven't even
gotten there yet</b></font>

13
00:01:01,810 --> 00:01:03,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and you're thinking
about work?</b></font>

14
00:01:03,860 --> 00:01:05,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd like to survive,</b></font>

15
00:01:05,650 --> 00:01:06,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>wouldn't you?</b></font>

16
00:01:06,860 --> 00:01:09,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Unless we stay two steps ahead,</b></font>

17
00:01:09,110 --> 00:01:11,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>our journey will come
to a premature end.</b></font>

18
00:01:12,870 --> 00:01:14,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I suppose that is true.</b></font>

19
00:01:15,910 --> 00:01:17,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So work it is.</b></font>

20
00:01:17,750 --> 00:01:19,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I hope we find
something suitable.</b></font>

21
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Funny.</b></font>

22
00:01:24,130 --> 00:01:25,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This feels familiar.</b></font>

23
00:01:28,010 --> 00:01:30,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Thank you very much
for the ride, sir.</b></font>

24
00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:32,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[COACHMAN] Don't mention it!</b></font>

25
00:01:32,260 --> 00:01:34,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's not every day I have
a first-class mage in my cart.</b></font>

26
00:01:34,850 --> 00:01:36,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I could breathe easy,
thanks to you.</b></font>

27
00:01:37,430 --> 00:01:40,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Goodness. You'll be on the road
to Ende for a while.</b></font>

28
00:01:40,770 --> 00:01:44,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Most folks would never dare
venture so far from home.</b></font>

29
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:45,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>To all of us in that camp,</b></font>

30
00:01:45,690 --> 00:01:49,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a journey like yours
sounds unimaginably long.</b></font>

31
00:01:51,070 --> 00:01:52,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren chuckles softly]</b></font>

32
00:01:53,860 --> 00:01:55,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Maybe it will be.</b></font>

33
00:01:57,870 --> 00:01:59,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

34
00:01:59,490 --> 00:02:03,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>FRIEREN: BEYOND JOURNEY'S END</b></font>

35
00:03:26,830 --> 00:03:28,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>29 YEARS AFTER THE DEATH
OF HIMMEL THE HERO,</b></font>

36
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:30,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>IN THE SAUM MARSHES, LOCATED
IN THE NORTHERN LANDS</b></font>

37
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

38
00:03:36,300 --> 00:03:38,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Uh? [grunts]</b></font>

39
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:48,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark sighs]</b></font>

40
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:56,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's not much,
but I caught one.</b></font>

41
00:03:56,990 --> 00:03:59,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] I'll add it
to our breakfast.</b></font>

42
00:03:59,820 --> 00:04:01,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

43
00:04:02,660 --> 00:04:04,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't say anything.
I already know.</b></font>

44
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[rustling]
-[FRIEREN] Um...</b></font>

45
00:04:06,790 --> 00:04:08,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How odd.</b></font>

46
00:04:08,540 --> 00:04:10,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It should be
around here somewhere.</b></font>

47
00:04:11,630 --> 00:04:12,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's up?</b></font>

48
00:04:12,790 --> 00:04:14,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Isn't it too early for her?</b></font>

49
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:16,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She woke up curious
about something.</b></font>

50
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:18,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And curiosity knows no clock.</b></font>

51
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:20,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hmm.</b></font>

52
00:04:20,050 --> 00:04:21,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You praised her, didn't you?</b></font>

53
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, of course.</b></font>

54
00:04:23,850 --> 00:04:25,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Found it.</b></font>

55
00:04:28,190 --> 00:04:30,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I had a feeling
it was a big one.</b></font>

56
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:32,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren chuckles softly]</b></font>

57
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:34,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] That's a pretty stone.</b></font>

58
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:35,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But what makes it so special?</b></font>

59
00:04:36,030 --> 00:04:37,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Here.</b></font>

60
00:04:39,700 --> 00:04:41,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Uh...</b></font>

61
00:04:41,950 --> 00:04:43,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hold on.</b></font>

62
00:04:44,660 --> 00:04:46,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't conjure fire.</b></font>

63
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:50,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] It's called
a magic-nullifying crystal.</b></font>

64
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:53,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's a mineral that
neutralizes magical effects.</b></font>

65
00:04:53,790 --> 00:04:54,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hmm.</b></font>

66
00:04:55,340 --> 00:04:56,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
A specimen of this purity</b></font>

67
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:59,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>has an effective radius
of three meters.</b></font>

68
00:04:59,130 --> 00:05:01,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Stark, step over there for me,
will you?</b></font>

69
00:05:01,930 --> 00:05:04,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Huh? Okay.</b></font>

70
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:08,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh? Here goes.</b></font>

71
00:05:08,270 --> 00:05:10,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is an extremely rare find.</b></font>

72
00:05:10,690 --> 00:05:12,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even if it were pebble-sized,</b></font>

73
00:05:12,310 --> 00:05:14,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it would be worth
several pieces of gold.</b></font>

74
00:05:14,730 --> 00:05:17,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A crystal this large
could buy us a mansion.</b></font>

75
00:05:18,280 --> 00:05:19,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sign me up.</b></font>

76
00:05:19,650 --> 00:05:20,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren chuckles softly]</b></font>

77
00:05:21,110 --> 00:05:23,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's great,
but it blocks our magic.</b></font>

78
00:05:23,620 --> 00:05:26,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Travelling with it would
render us completely useless.</b></font>

79
00:05:27,290 --> 00:05:29,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Keep it and we're
dead men walking.</b></font>

80
00:05:29,540 --> 00:05:31,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>'Tis the burden we bear.</b></font>

81
00:05:31,750 --> 00:05:34,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't bear it.
Please get rid of the rock.</b></font>

82
00:05:34,880 --> 00:05:37,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If a monster attacked right now,
we'd all be wiped out.</b></font>

83
00:05:37,710 --> 00:05:39,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fine. But it would be
a shame</b></font>

84
00:05:39,260 --> 00:05:42,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to leave it without sharing
its flashiest property.</b></font>

85
00:05:42,340 --> 00:05:44,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's truly a terrific show.</b></font>

86
00:05:44,220 --> 00:05:47,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When you imbue these stones
with a large amount of mana...</b></font>

87
00:05:47,220 --> 00:05:48,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark gasps]</b></font>

88
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]...they glow
with an impressive light.</b></font>

89
00:05:53,520 --> 00:05:54,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] It's blinding me.</b></font>

90
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:56,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN]
Just throw that thing away.</b></font>

91
00:05:56,270 --> 00:05:57,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

92
00:06:00,570 --> 00:06:02,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's still glowing.</b></font>

93
00:06:03,660 --> 00:06:04,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Keep up our pace,</b></font>

94
00:06:04,870 --> 00:06:06,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and we'll reach
the next village today.</b></font>

95
00:06:07,700 --> 00:06:09,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's good, right?</b></font>

96
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:11,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're finally getting close
to the Northern Plateau.</b></font>

97
00:06:11,410 --> 00:06:13,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The plateau is very far away.</b></font>

98
00:06:13,620 --> 00:06:15,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We still must venture
through a vast forest</b></font>

99
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and volcanic area.</b></font>

100
00:06:17,710 --> 00:06:19,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A volcanic area?</b></font>

101
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:21,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sounds like we're in
for some real danger.</b></font>

102
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
I wouldn't say that.</b></font>

103
00:06:23,840 --> 00:06:26,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There hasn't been
an eruption in centuries.</b></font>

104
00:06:26,300 --> 00:06:29,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>These days, it's a relatively
safe hot spring region.</b></font>

105
00:06:29,390 --> 00:06:30,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A hot spring sounds nice.</b></font>

106
00:06:31,020 --> 00:06:32,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It feels like
it's been a lifetime</b></font>

107
00:06:32,810 --> 00:06:34,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>since I had a warm bath.</b></font>

108
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:37,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're long overdue
for some rest and relaxation.</b></font>

109
00:06:42,570 --> 00:06:45,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Strange.
Stop for a moment.</b></font>

110
00:06:45,320 --> 00:06:47,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The earth here
is exceptionally thin.</b></font>

111
00:06:47,870 --> 00:06:49,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[rumbling]
-[Stark screams]</b></font>

112
00:06:58,290 --> 00:06:59,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just as I thought.</b></font>

113
00:06:59,710 --> 00:07:02,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It seems we've stumbled
upon an underground cave.</b></font>

114
00:07:02,630 --> 00:07:05,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The ground of a marshland
can never be trusted.</b></font>

115
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:08,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey. Mistress Frieren?</b></font>

116
00:07:09,220 --> 00:07:10,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh...</b></font>

117
00:07:11,350 --> 00:07:13,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Land rump first.
-[STARK] Wait, what?</b></font>

118
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:16,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark screaming]</b></font>

119
00:07:16,230 --> 00:07:18,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark groans]</b></font>

120
00:07:18,730 --> 00:07:19,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark screams]</b></font>

121
00:07:20,650 --> 00:07:23,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] No wonder we found
that magic-nullifying crystal</b></font>

122
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:24,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>on the surface.</b></font>

123
00:07:24,570 --> 00:07:26,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've never seen
a deposit this large before.</b></font>

124
00:07:27,030 --> 00:07:28,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Please get off me.</b></font>

125
00:07:28,660 --> 00:07:29,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

126
00:07:30,910 --> 00:07:34,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This cave is practically filled
to the brim with them.</b></font>

127
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If we brought it
all back with us,</b></font>

128
00:07:35,790 --> 00:07:37,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we'd be rich as kings.</b></font>

129
00:07:37,370 --> 00:07:39,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm afraid we're not
up to the task.</b></font>

130
00:07:39,210 --> 00:07:40,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Oh.</b></font>

131
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:42,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Magic-nullifying crystal</b></font>

132
00:07:42,460 --> 00:07:45,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is one of the hardest materials
in existence.</b></font>

133
00:07:45,300 --> 00:07:48,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That, and unlike most stones
I've encountered,</b></font>

134
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:51,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it can neither be cut
nor processed using magic.</b></font>

135
00:07:53,850 --> 00:07:54,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hmm.</b></font>

136
00:08:07,490 --> 00:08:08,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hm?</b></font>

137
00:08:09,910 --> 00:08:11,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
Some treasures of nature</b></font>

138
00:08:11,370 --> 00:08:13,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>are simply
out of humanity's reach.</b></font>

139
00:08:14,330 --> 00:08:17,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In any case, we're not climbing
our way out of here.</b></font>

140
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's look for another exit.</b></font>

141
00:08:27,010 --> 00:08:28,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, why the face?</b></font>

142
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:31,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're counting
on you now, Stark.</b></font>

143
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:33,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't fail.</b></font>

144
00:08:33,680 --> 00:08:36,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Since we can't use magic
to defend ourselves, down here,</b></font>

145
00:08:36,220 --> 00:08:38,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we're helpless young ladies.</b></font>

146
00:08:38,850 --> 00:08:40,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Young ladies?</b></font>

147
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:41,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Careful.</b></font>

148
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:43,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I still haven't forgiven
your "old hag" quip</b></font>

149
00:08:43,610 --> 00:08:44,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from the dragon duel.</b></font>

150
00:08:45,610 --> 00:08:47,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okay, I'm sorry.</b></font>

151
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:49,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Expert grudge-holding.</b></font>

152
00:08:49,110 --> 00:08:50,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

153
00:09:18,640 --> 00:09:20,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK]
When I imagined our journey,</b></font>

154
00:09:20,350 --> 00:09:21,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I never pictured camping</b></font>

155
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:23,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-in a place like this.
-[Frieren snores]</b></font>

156
00:09:23,860 --> 00:09:26,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] This cave complex
is immense.</b></font>

157
00:09:26,570 --> 00:09:28,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Unbelievably so.</b></font>

158
00:09:28,490 --> 00:09:32,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I'm not fond of the number
of animal bones we've found.</b></font>

159
00:09:33,490 --> 00:09:35,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>According to Mistress Frieren,</b></font>

160
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:38,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>this might be the den
of a giant monster.</b></font>

161
00:09:39,790 --> 00:09:42,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm amazed she can
sleep so soundly.</b></font>

162
00:09:42,370 --> 00:09:44,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK]
Not a care in the world.</b></font>

163
00:09:46,420 --> 00:09:47,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Even down here,</b></font>

164
00:09:47,630 --> 00:09:49,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>she still seems
to be having fun.</b></font>

165
00:09:51,340 --> 00:09:53,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm far too afraid to join in.</b></font>

166
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:56,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't even detect mana.</b></font>

167
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:06,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I feel so isolated and helpless.</b></font>

168
00:10:06,110 --> 00:10:10,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's like I've been plunged
into total darkness.</b></font>

169
00:10:11,150 --> 00:10:12,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm here.</b></font>

170
00:10:12,650 --> 00:10:13,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[loud rumbling]
-[gasping]</b></font>

171
00:10:16,530 --> 00:10:17,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both gasp]</b></font>

172
00:10:18,030 --> 00:10:19,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] A monster!</b></font>

173
00:10:20,290 --> 00:10:22,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Frieren? Wake up! Now!</b></font>

174
00:10:28,500 --> 00:10:30,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
A venomous apex dragon.</b></font>

175
00:10:30,170 --> 00:10:31,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Venomous?</b></font>

176
00:10:31,670 --> 00:10:33,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's a terrible matchup
for you.</b></font>

177
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:35,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You'll die from poison again.</b></font>

178
00:10:35,590 --> 00:10:37,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I didn't die the first time.</b></font>

179
00:10:37,470 --> 00:10:40,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And it doesn't matter.
I've got to fight it, don't I?</b></font>

180
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:42,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't believe you were
drooling like a baby.</b></font>

181
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:45,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-How could you sleep so--
-I could sleep so soundly</b></font>

182
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:47,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>because I trust you
with my life, Stark.</b></font>

183
00:10:49,980 --> 00:10:51,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hmm.</b></font>

184
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:53,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That feeling
solidified within me</b></font>

185
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:56,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the very moment I recruited you
to be our warrior.</b></font>

186
00:10:56,660 --> 00:10:57,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A party can't function properly</b></font>

187
00:10:58,030 --> 00:11:00,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>without complete
and utter trust.</b></font>

188
00:11:02,250 --> 00:11:03,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why would you trust someone</b></font>

189
00:11:03,620 --> 00:11:05,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>whose only skill
is running away?</b></font>

190
00:11:06,420 --> 00:11:09,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If I had a choice,
I would run right now.</b></font>

191
00:11:09,710 --> 00:11:11,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Is that so?</b></font>

192
00:11:11,210 --> 00:11:13,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Shall we run away together then?</b></font>

193
00:11:13,550 --> 00:11:17,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Stark, Fern,
please close your eyes.</b></font>

194
00:11:24,020 --> 00:11:25,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN] Himmel.</b></font>

195
00:11:25,140 --> 00:11:27,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you truly trust me
with your life,</b></font>

196
00:11:27,690 --> 00:11:29,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I question your sanity.</b></font>

197
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:30,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL] Hm?</b></font>

198
00:11:30,730 --> 00:11:34,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN] Your faith should
not be so easily won.</b></font>

199
00:11:34,940 --> 00:11:36,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles softly]</b></font>

200
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:40,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN]
I abandoned my village and fled.</b></font>

201
00:11:41,910 --> 00:11:43,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is that so?</b></font>

202
00:11:43,910 --> 00:11:47,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fine. If you want to run,
we can run away together.</b></font>

203
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:48,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN] Hmm.</b></font>

204
00:11:49,420 --> 00:11:52,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're a party.
We'll follow where you lead.</b></font>

205
00:11:52,800 --> 00:11:54,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[explosion]</b></font>

206
00:11:57,880 --> 00:11:59,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[roars]</b></font>

207
00:12:03,430 --> 00:12:04,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

208
00:12:10,810 --> 00:12:11,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[exclaims]</b></font>

209
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:16,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Eisen scoffs, grunts]</b></font>

210
00:12:19,570 --> 00:12:20,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Himmel sighs]</b></font>

211
00:12:24,790 --> 00:12:26,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Running sounds like a good plan.</b></font>

212
00:12:26,750 --> 00:12:28,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

213
00:12:30,670 --> 00:12:32,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Scoundrel! You took the pebble</b></font>

214
00:12:32,210 --> 00:12:33,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and left the priest
with the boulder!</b></font>

215
00:12:33,750 --> 00:12:36,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because the pebble will complain
you stink of liquor!</b></font>

216
00:12:36,460 --> 00:12:38,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Himmel chuckles]</b></font>

217
00:12:39,090 --> 00:12:41,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

218
00:12:41,340 --> 00:12:43,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

219
00:12:52,400 --> 00:12:54,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark panting]</b></font>

220
00:12:56,030 --> 00:12:57,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That was scary.</b></font>

221
00:12:57,690 --> 00:13:00,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But running away as a team
isn't so miserable.</b></font>

222
00:13:01,530 --> 00:13:02,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Yeah.</b></font>

223
00:13:03,070 --> 00:13:05,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark continues panting]</b></font>

224
00:13:09,410 --> 00:13:11,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
Shall we be off, then?</b></font>

225
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:17,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Frieren.</b></font>

226
00:13:17,340 --> 00:13:18,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What now?</b></font>

227
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:21,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't get my legs
to take another step.</b></font>

228
00:13:21,930 --> 00:13:24,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>EPISODE 29: SHALL WE GO, THEN?</b></font>

229
00:13:24,970 --> 00:13:26,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>29 YEARS AFTER THE DEATH
OF HIMMEL THE HERO,</b></font>

230
00:13:26,930 --> 00:13:29,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>IN THE GREAT SANFT FOREST,
LOCATED IN THE NORTHERN LANDS</b></font>

231
00:13:29,930 --> 00:13:31,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK]
Will this be enough for lunch?</b></font>

232
00:13:31,940 --> 00:13:34,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe I should have
picked some more.</b></font>

233
00:13:34,060 --> 00:13:34,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh?</b></font>

234
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:38,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're kidding!
I'm the first one back?</b></font>

235
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:40,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I guess I was too quick
with the gathering, huh?</b></font>

236
00:13:45,070 --> 00:13:48,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, it wouldn't hurt
to get some fishing in.</b></font>

237
00:13:49,370 --> 00:13:52,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm gonna bag a big one
this time. I can feel it.</b></font>

238
00:13:53,040 --> 00:13:54,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren shivering]</b></font>

239
00:13:55,040 --> 00:13:56,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] So cold.</b></font>

240
00:13:57,750 --> 00:14:00,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] We'll reach
the hot springs soon enough.</b></font>

241
00:14:09,970 --> 00:14:12,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There. Good as new.</b></font>

242
00:14:12,690 --> 00:14:15,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That was given to you
by Stark, right?</b></font>

243
00:14:15,190 --> 00:14:17,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A mirrored-lotus bracelet
is quite the gift.</b></font>

244
00:14:19,110 --> 00:14:21,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I also cleaned off
the hairpin you gave me.</b></font>

245
00:14:21,740 --> 00:14:23,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All bright and shiny again.</b></font>

246
00:14:23,660 --> 00:14:25,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're careful
with your staff, too.</b></font>

247
00:14:25,740 --> 00:14:27,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You seem to relish the ritual</b></font>

248
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:29,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of maintaining
your equipment, Fern.</b></font>

249
00:14:29,660 --> 00:14:30,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You think so?</b></font>

250
00:14:31,250 --> 00:14:33,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You've been smiling
this whole time.</b></font>

251
00:14:33,290 --> 00:14:35,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern chuckles softly]</b></font>

252
00:14:35,750 --> 00:14:38,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Maybe I care so much
because they were gifts.</b></font>

253
00:14:39,250 --> 00:14:40,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I lost everything,</b></font>

254
00:14:40,670 --> 00:14:44,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from my home to the objects
that filled it, to war.</b></font>

255
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:47,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Perhaps a part of me
just cherishes the chance</b></font>

256
00:14:47,300 --> 00:14:49,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to own things
with meaning again.</b></font>

257
00:14:50,640 --> 00:14:52,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then it was
well worth the headache</b></font>

258
00:14:52,180 --> 00:14:53,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>picking it out for you.</b></font>

259
00:14:54,350 --> 00:14:56,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It took you a long time
to choose.</b></font>

260
00:14:56,690 --> 00:14:58,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How do you know about that?</b></font>

261
00:14:58,650 --> 00:15:00,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[chuckles]
-[rustling]</b></font>

262
00:15:00,070 --> 00:15:01,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

263
00:15:01,190 --> 00:15:02,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Uh...</b></font>

264
00:15:02,740 --> 00:15:03,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Pervert!</b></font>

265
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:08,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I am so, so sorry.</b></font>

266
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:11,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I had no idea the two of you
would be bathing, I swear.</b></font>

267
00:15:12,450 --> 00:15:14,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm obviously not angry.</b></font>

268
00:15:15,870 --> 00:15:17,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And there. All done.</b></font>

269
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:24,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Hmm.</b></font>

270
00:15:31,640 --> 00:15:32,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh.</b></font>

271
00:15:34,230 --> 00:15:35,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How confounding.</b></font>

272
00:15:36,020 --> 00:15:37,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Something's not right here.</b></font>

273
00:15:37,560 --> 00:15:38,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Like what?</b></font>

274
00:15:38,980 --> 00:15:41,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Am I alone in feeling
an awkward tension in the air?</b></font>

275
00:15:42,020 --> 00:15:43,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Definitely not.</b></font>

276
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:45,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So you're finally
starting to pick up</b></font>

277
00:15:45,400 --> 00:15:47,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>on the more
touchy-feely stuff, huh?</b></font>

278
00:15:48,030 --> 00:15:49,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's some major growth.</b></font>

279
00:15:49,870 --> 00:15:52,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] This seems to happen
with some frequency.</b></font>

280
00:15:52,410 --> 00:15:55,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Perhaps you two
are simply ill-matched.</b></font>

281
00:15:55,080 --> 00:15:57,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK]
I wouldn't go that far.</b></font>

282
00:15:58,460 --> 00:15:59,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Listen, Stark.</b></font>

283
00:15:59,540 --> 00:16:00,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hm?</b></font>

284
00:16:01,090 --> 00:16:02,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
If you're uncomfortable,</b></font>

285
00:16:02,380 --> 00:16:04,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you can always just say so.</b></font>

286
00:16:04,460 --> 00:16:06,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You wouldn't be in this party
to begin with</b></font>

287
00:16:06,630 --> 00:16:08,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if I hadn't forced you
to join us.</b></font>

288
00:16:09,430 --> 00:16:12,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you hadn't forced me?
That's not why I--</b></font>

289
00:16:13,310 --> 00:16:15,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN]
We're at a crossroads.</b></font>

290
00:16:19,020 --> 00:16:21,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] It seems this path
leads to the Northern Plateau,</b></font>

291
00:16:22,020 --> 00:16:24,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>while Neutral Harbor
lies down the other.</b></font>

292
00:16:25,070 --> 00:16:27,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Frieren, over there.</b></font>

293
00:16:28,110 --> 00:16:30,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Does that look like an inn
to you?</b></font>

294
00:16:31,950 --> 00:16:33,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] This is
a frequently traveled road.</b></font>

295
00:16:34,620 --> 00:16:36,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At least we won't have
to camp out tonight.</b></font>

296
00:16:37,830 --> 00:16:38,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[bell dinging]</b></font>

297
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:40,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[WIRBEL] Oh?</b></font>

298
00:16:40,710 --> 00:16:42,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, look who it is!</b></font>

299
00:16:42,630 --> 00:16:44,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[FRIEREN] Hm?
-[laughs]</b></font>

300
00:16:45,460 --> 00:16:48,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seems our reunion came
sooner than expected.</b></font>

301
00:16:49,010 --> 00:16:51,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>By the way, Stark,
thanks again for your help</b></font>

302
00:16:51,760 --> 00:16:53,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with that Fresser business.</b></font>

303
00:16:53,600 --> 00:16:55,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sure thing, Wirbel.</b></font>

304
00:16:55,470 --> 00:16:56,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You seem to be well.</b></font>

305
00:16:58,770 --> 00:17:01,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ultimately, I decided
to travel home by sea.</b></font>

306
00:17:02,270 --> 00:17:03,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>News from the north is dire.</b></font>

307
00:17:04,020 --> 00:17:06,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The demons are acting up
in the far reaches.</b></font>

308
00:17:06,940 --> 00:17:10,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need to get up there
as fast as possible.</b></font>

309
00:17:10,240 --> 00:17:11,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm with these two</b></font>

310
00:17:11,450 --> 00:17:13,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>until we make it to the capital,
that is.</b></font>

311
00:17:13,660 --> 00:17:16,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's anxious about seasickness.
The whining's incessant.</b></font>

312
00:17:16,740 --> 00:17:19,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I thought you were
a grown man, Wirbel.</b></font>

313
00:17:19,040 --> 00:17:20,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're far too old for whining.</b></font>

314
00:17:20,670 --> 00:17:22,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Think so?</b></font>

315
00:17:22,250 --> 00:17:25,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Here I thought I was still in
the full flower of my youth.</b></font>

316
00:17:25,750 --> 00:17:28,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm only a recent departee
from my twenties.</b></font>

317
00:17:28,340 --> 00:17:32,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Funny. All you old guys
suffer from the same delusions.</b></font>

318
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:35,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[WIRBEL] Anyway, Stark.</b></font>

319
00:17:35,850 --> 00:17:38,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Have you had time to think
about my proposition?</b></font>

320
00:17:38,470 --> 00:17:39,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Proposition?</b></font>

321
00:17:42,140 --> 00:17:45,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The situation up north has gone
from bad to worse, quick.</b></font>

322
00:17:45,230 --> 00:17:48,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Reliable front-line fighters
are in serious demand.</b></font>

323
00:17:50,110 --> 00:17:51,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're free to say no.</b></font>

324
00:17:52,150 --> 00:17:54,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But we could really use
your axe, Stark.</b></font>

325
00:17:54,570 --> 00:17:57,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just for a few years
until things stabilize.</b></font>

326
00:17:59,660 --> 00:18:01,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's like I told you before,
Wirbel.</b></font>

327
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:04,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My services
have been pledged already.</b></font>

328
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's fair.</b></font>

329
00:18:06,250 --> 00:18:08,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But it's not in my nature
to give up easy.</b></font>

330
00:18:08,710 --> 00:18:10,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When it comes
to the safety of the north,</b></font>

331
00:18:10,630 --> 00:18:12,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I would do anything.</b></font>

332
00:18:12,880 --> 00:18:14,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Uh...</b></font>

333
00:18:14,590 --> 00:18:17,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, Frieren.
Can I work on him a bit?</b></font>

334
00:18:18,850 --> 00:18:21,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Wait--
-You may do as you wish.</b></font>

335
00:18:21,480 --> 00:18:22,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[WIRBEL] Hmm.</b></font>

336
00:18:24,270 --> 00:18:25,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mistress Frieren.</b></font>

337
00:18:26,690 --> 00:18:29,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[ALL] Cheers.
-[Wirbel chuckles]</b></font>

338
00:18:29,150 --> 00:18:31,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm telling you, Stark,
I'm a fun guy to be around.</b></font>

339
00:18:31,690 --> 00:18:33,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
Seems he's having fun.</b></font>

340
00:18:33,110 --> 00:18:34,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[SCHARF] Indeed.
-[STARK] Appreciate the offer...</b></font>

341
00:18:34,820 --> 00:18:36,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sure it's a nice
change of pace for him.</b></font>

342
00:18:36,950 --> 00:18:39,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Stark must find our party
somewhat restrictive</b></font>

343
00:18:39,290 --> 00:18:40,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>by comparison.</b></font>

344
00:18:40,370 --> 00:18:41,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[WIRBEL]...coins
and maidens' hearts.</b></font>

345
00:18:41,910 --> 00:18:43,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Yeah, that doesn't sound
like my kind of thing.</b></font>

346
00:18:47,040 --> 00:18:48,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door opens]</b></font>

347
00:18:49,090 --> 00:18:50,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door closes]</b></font>

348
00:18:52,550 --> 00:18:54,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So... how'd it go?</b></font>

349
00:18:55,380 --> 00:18:58,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I turned down Wirbel's offer,
if that's what you mean.</b></font>

350
00:19:01,640 --> 00:19:04,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Are you certain?
You don't have to stay.</b></font>

351
00:19:05,270 --> 00:19:06,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know,</b></font>

352
00:19:06,690 --> 00:19:08,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't think either of you
realize why I'm here.</b></font>

353
00:19:11,530 --> 00:19:15,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When I first met you
and Frieren, I was at my limit.</b></font>

354
00:19:15,490 --> 00:19:17,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I couldn't see
the meaning in it anymore.</b></font>

355
00:19:18,870 --> 00:19:21,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Truth be told,
I was ready to cut and run.</b></font>

356
00:19:21,240 --> 00:19:23,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Leave that village
to fend for itself.</b></font>

357
00:19:24,410 --> 00:19:25,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Real heroic, huh?</b></font>

358
00:19:26,790 --> 00:19:28,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Frieren doesn't get it.</b></font>

359
00:19:28,460 --> 00:19:29,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's under the impression</b></font>

360
00:19:29,590 --> 00:19:31,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that she forced me
to join this party</b></font>

361
00:19:31,500 --> 00:19:33,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>against my will.
But she's wrong.</b></font>

362
00:19:34,010 --> 00:19:35,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

363
00:19:39,100 --> 00:19:40,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We just met. But...</b></font>

364
00:19:41,430 --> 00:19:43,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't think you'll run.</b></font>

365
00:19:47,730 --> 00:19:49,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Your encouragement
relit a fire in me</b></font>

366
00:19:49,900 --> 00:19:52,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that had been cold
for a long time.</b></font>

367
00:19:52,110 --> 00:19:54,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In that moment, I knew
the right thing to do</b></font>

368
00:19:54,230 --> 00:19:55,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>was to go with you.</b></font>

369
00:19:56,780 --> 00:19:59,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe you're just too modest
to have noticed it.</b></font>

370
00:20:00,030 --> 00:20:01,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But Frieren isn't
the only reason</b></font>

371
00:20:01,740 --> 00:20:03,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>my cowardly hide is still here.</b></font>

372
00:20:03,910 --> 00:20:05,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're also to blame.</b></font>

373
00:20:07,290 --> 00:20:08,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark chuckles]</b></font>

374
00:20:09,920 --> 00:20:12,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I promise
I'm not going anywhere.</b></font>

375
00:20:12,380 --> 00:20:13,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern chuckles softly]</b></font>

376
00:20:13,590 --> 00:20:15,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[soft thudding]
-[Ferns gasps]</b></font>

377
00:20:15,340 --> 00:20:18,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So please try
and be nicer to me, okay?</b></font>

378
00:20:20,340 --> 00:20:21,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Very well then.</b></font>

379
00:20:21,890 --> 00:20:24,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Come here, Stark.
Time for head pats.</b></font>

380
00:20:24,600 --> 00:20:27,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[exclaims] What evil
are you plotting? Stay away!</b></font>

381
00:20:27,850 --> 00:20:29,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN]
What a pain in the rear.</b></font>

382
00:20:32,690 --> 00:20:34,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren snoring]</b></font>

383
00:20:36,570 --> 00:20:38,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

384
00:20:49,330 --> 00:20:51,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathing shakily]</b></font>

385
00:20:57,340 --> 00:20:58,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles softly]</b></font>

386
00:21:10,520 --> 00:21:11,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern blows]</b></font>

387
00:21:12,560 --> 00:21:14,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[birds chirping]</b></font>

388
00:21:16,190 --> 00:21:18,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[WIRBEL] I guess I couldn't
convince you after all.</b></font>

389
00:21:19,360 --> 00:21:20,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You three should take the boat.</b></font>

390
00:21:20,860 --> 00:21:22,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It would save you valuable time.</b></font>

391
00:21:23,200 --> 00:21:25,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ocean travel
is a tad too expensive.</b></font>

392
00:21:26,910 --> 00:21:28,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's fine.</b></font>

393
00:21:28,290 --> 00:21:29,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

394
00:21:29,830 --> 00:21:31,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My master's party trekked
through the Northern Plateau,</b></font>

395
00:21:31,580 --> 00:21:32,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and so will we.</b></font>

396
00:21:32,960 --> 00:21:34,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern chuckles]</b></font>

397
00:21:35,290 --> 00:21:37,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're always accepting odd jobs.</b></font>

398
00:21:37,670 --> 00:21:40,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And landing ourselves
in all manner of trouble.</b></font>

399
00:21:40,550 --> 00:21:42,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Detours are a part
of our process.</b></font>

400
00:21:44,970 --> 00:21:46,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles] You've carved out</b></font>

401
00:21:46,390 --> 00:21:48,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>quite the adventurous path
for yourselves,</b></font>

402
00:21:48,060 --> 00:21:49,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and I won't block it.</b></font>

403
00:21:50,140 --> 00:21:51,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So long.</b></font>

404
00:21:51,520 --> 00:21:53,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sure you'll reach
the far north eventually.</b></font>

405
00:21:54,650 --> 00:21:57,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But until then, you take care.</b></font>

406
00:22:02,950 --> 00:22:04,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, shall we be off?</b></font>

407
00:22:04,570 --> 00:22:05,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

408
00:22:19,920 --> 00:22:22,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

409
00:23:50,140 --> 00:23:51,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK]
That seems a bit extreme.</b></font>

410
00:23:51,510 --> 00:23:53,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN] Talk about tyrannical.</b></font>

411
00:23:53,140 --> 00:23:54,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HEITER] Or maybe your joy
merely grows with our sorrow?</b></font>

412
00:23:54,680 --> 00:23:56,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HERO OF THE SOUTH] I'll die
without achieving my goal.</b></font>

413
00:23:56,850 --> 00:23:58,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL]
At least we defeated a demon.</b></font>

414
00:23:58,440 --> 00:23:59,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
"That's the Hero of the South."</b></font>

